# VTID-03740 — commands actually run.

# --- Investigation --------------------------------------------------------
# Reported live, with screenshot: tapping the ORB on the pre-login MAXINA
# Intro screen shows the "speaking" caption ("Vitana priča...") and amber
# glow, but no audio plays and the session stays stuck that way.
#
# Dispatched two research agents in sequence:
# 1. Confirmed Serbian ('sr') ORB voice is already robustly, structurally
#    forced onto Nova Sonic at multiple independent, test-pinned layers —
#    Polly has no Serbian voice in any engine (POLLY_UNSUPPORTED_LANGS),
#    the cascade rescue independently refuses 'sr' derived from the same
#    live Polly table (not a duplicated list), and Nova's own voice table
#    falls back to the documented 'tina' substitute. No code change needed
#    there — separate from this bug.
# 2. Investigated the silent-but-"speaking" symptom specifically:

grep -n "case 'audio': case 'audio_out':" \
  services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js
#   -> confirms _setStatus(_caption('speaking')) fires on the FIRST audio
#      chunk received, before playback or turn completion

grep -n "_waitForAudioEnd" services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js
#   -> confirms this is the ONLY place that resets voiceState/caption/orb
#      back to listening, and it only runs inside case 'turn_complete' —
#      i.e. only if the SERVER sends turn_complete

grep -n "function _speakingStateWatchdog" -A 20 \
  services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js
#   -> confirms the pre-existing DEV-COMHU-0501 watchdog already correctly
#      DETECTS the stall (quiet >=2s, nothing scheduled, empty queue) but
#      only ever cleared the internal audioPlaying flag + refreshed the mic
#      button — never touched .vtorb-status, the orb glow, voiceState, or
#      the mic. Detecting the stall didn't fix anything visible.

grep -n "function _updateUI" -A 25 \
  services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js
#   -> confirms _updateUI() (called by the watchdog) only handles the mic
#      button and FAB visibility — never the caption or orb glow.

# Root cause: the watchdog already correctly detects a Nova stream that
# delivered SOME audio then died before turn_complete, but its recovery
# action was incomplete — internal-only, not visible/functional.

# --- Fix --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Extended _speakingStateWatchdog(): when it fires while voiceState is
# still 'SPEAKING' (the exact stuck-caption case) and the session is
# genuinely still active (not closing for nav, not user-closed, overlay
# visible), it now also resets voiceState/orb-glow/caption to LISTENING
# (skipped only when the VTID-03469 audio-blocked tap-to-hear prompt is
# showing) and re-arms the mic exactly once, gated on !greetingComplete —
# mirroring the existing single-start invariant for _startAudioCapture().
# Deliberately does NOT invoke the host's turn-completion callback, since
# this turn never genuinely completed (would reproduce the VTID-03685
# "completed drawer for undelivered content" bug).

node -c services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/orb-widget.js
#   -> exit 0, syntax valid

# --- Cache-bust bump (CLAUDE.md IF-THEN rule 25) -----------------------------

grep -rn "orb-widget.js?v=" services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/index.html \
  ../../vitana-v1/index.html 2>/dev/null
# Both bumped from ?v=20260825-tr-captions to ?v=20260825-stuck-speaking-watchdog

